# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# The caller queued STAT, UIDL, QUIT. Interrupt arrives while STAT is in
# flight, so the STAT reply is still read and the next command is QUIT.
# UIDL is not sent.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: STAT
INTERRUPT
S: +OK 2 320
C: QUIT
S: +OK bye
DONE
